* {{rhymes|de|eːɐ̯də|ɛʁdə|s1=2}}

===Etymology 1===
{{dercat|de|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|hert}}, from {{inh|de|goh|herta}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*herdu}}.

The modern consonantism is [[Central German|Central]] and [[Low German]] (compare {{cog|gml|hērde}}). Cognate with {{cog|en|herd}}, {{cog|da|hjord}}, {{cog|sv|hjord}}, {{cog|got|𐌷𐌰𐌹𐍂𐌳𐌰}}.

